  "Number": 3,
  "Question": "The point in the \\(xy\\)-plane with coordinates \\((1000, 2012)\\) is reflected across the line \\(y=2000.\\) What are the coordinates of the reflected point?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\( (998,2012) \\)",
    "B": "\\( (1000,1988) \\)",
    "C": "\\( (1000,2024) \\)",
    "D": "\\( (1000,4012) \\)",
    "E": "\\( (1012,2012) \\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Solution": "A reflection places the image the same perpendicular distance on the opposite side of the mirror line. Because \\(y=2000\\) is horizontal, this movement is vertical, so the \\(x\\)-coordinate stays \\(1000\\).\n\nThe original point is \\(2012-2000=12\\) units above the line. Its image is therefore \\(12\\) units below it, with\n\\[y=2000-12=1988.\\]\nThe reflected point is \\(\\boxed{(1000,1988)}\\), choice B.",
